1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,590
Va’dani bajardik!

2
00:00:01,610 --> 00:00:08,779
Eng ko‘p layk olgan g‘oya — o‘ttiz besh layk bilan, Islom Muhammadovdan: shaharga mega market va uzun bino quraylik!

3
00:00:08,799 --> 00:00:11,619
Mana — ZAMIN FK City’da qurildi!

4
00:00:11,639 --> 00:00:12,819
Mega market.

5
00:00:12,839 --> 00:00:14,355
Va uzun bino!

6
00:00:14,375 --> 00:00:16,470
Endi yangi muxlislar ro‘yxati!

7
00:00:16,490 --> 00:00:19,330
Videoni to‘xtating — o‘zingizni topdingizmi?

8
00:00:22,555 --> 00:00:23,506
Topdingizmi?

9
00:00:23,526 --> 00:00:25,466
Izohga «topdim» deb yozing.

10
00:00:25,486 --> 00:00:29,543
Topolmasangiz — obuna bo‘ling, keyingi ro‘yxatda siz bo‘lasiz!

11
00:00:29,563 --> 00:00:33,823
Keyingi g‘oya ham sizdan: eng ko‘p layk olgan izoh quriladi!

12
00:00:33,843 --> 00:00:35,360
ZAMIN FK.

13
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:36,900
Siz tomosha qilmaysiz.

14
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:38,320
Siz qurasiz.

